-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",130,{
[4129]="7004E4ED\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl would like to speak with you. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n2\tSabotage crude defences (total: 6)\tCrude defences can be found at the entrances to Utterby. You should secretly sabotage the Jangovar's defences.\n3\tTalk to Otkóz\tYou should talk to Otkóz. who can be found inside Utterby.\n",
[4130]="70047A8A\n1\tEnter the maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk\tThe maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills. You should destroy Orc supplies scattered around the caverns.\n2\tDestroy Orc supplies in Skoironk (total: 10)\tThe maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills. You should destroy Orc supplies scattered around the caverns.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many supplies in Skoironk.\n",
[4131]="700378DC\n1\tDefeat the Orc defilers at the mill pond (total: 8)\tWhite Hand defilers have gathered around the pond in the Deeping Coomb and are attempting to call forth disturbed spirits to assail the Rohirrim. Defeating the defilers will end the foul ritual, but the spirits will need to be dealt with once they have been called forth.\n",
[4132]="700191C1\n1\tCollect a fungal sample\030Collect a crystal sample\030Collect a grodbog venom sac\tThe infected Orcs can be found south of the Shadowed Refuge. Crystal fragments can be found in the Fanged Pit, in Durin's Way, to the north-east. Venomous gredbyg can be found in the Redhorn Lodes, west of the Shadowed Refuge. Hethuwen has asked you bring her a fungal sample from the Orcs in the Foundations of Stone, a crystal from the Fanged Pit, and a venom sac from one of the vicious gredbyg in the Redhorn Lodes.\n2\tBring the materials to Hethuwen at the Shadowed Refuge\030Collect a fungal sample\030Collect a crystal sample\030Collect a venom sack\tThe Shadowed Refuge can be found in the Foundations of Stone, in the south-east reaches of Moria. You should return with the gathered samples to Hethuwen at the Shadowed Refuge.\n",
[4133]="7005A72D\n1\tDestroy sapper-bomb crates at Atrad-zarakh\tCrates of sapper-bombs can be found all over Atrad-zarakh. Destroying them before they find their targets would save the Haban'akkâ much trouble.\n2\tDestroy sapper-bomb crates (total: 7)\tCrates of sapper-bombs can be found all over Atrad-zarakh. Destroying them before they find their targets would save the Haban'akkâ much trouble.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed all the sapper-bomb crates you could find.\n",
[4134]="7002804E\n1\tDefeat goblins in the Orc-mines (total: 8)\tGoblins can be found throughout the Orc-mines. Ondor asked you to defeat goblins in the Orc-mines, but warned you to beware their deadly new weapons.\n2\tTalk to Ondor the Dwarf in the Orc-mines\tOndor the Dwarf is in the Orc-mines. You should return to Ondor with news of your success.\n",
[4135]="70042958\n1\tTalk to Tom Bombadil, and ask him about himself\tBingo is unsure how best to describe Tom Bombadil for his written account of the journey, and has asked you to go directly to the subject for answers.\n2\tStand in the foam of the waterfall south of Tom's house\tTom Bombadil asked you to stand in the foam of the waterfall south of his house, if you want to learn about him.\n3\tDespite being so soggy, talk to Tom Bombadil\tYou stood in the waterfall that Tom suggested, and should now see what you were supposed to have learned from the experience.\n4\tFind Old Man Willow, west of Tom Bombadil's house\tOld Man Willow is further west along the Withywindle, west of Tom Bombadil's house. Tom Bombadil has asked you to go dance with Old Man Willow if you will learn what it is to care about the same things as Tom.\n5\tTalk to Tom Bombadil\tTom Bombadil is at his house to the east of Old Man Willow. You have danced with Old Man Willow, as Tom requested.\n6\tTalk to Bingo outside Bombadil's house\tBingo is outside Tom Bombadil's house, in the Old Forest. You tried to learn more about Tom Bombadil, but the mysterious fellow does not seem given to explanations.\n7\tBring Bingo's manuscript to Tom Bombadil for his perusal\tBingo has asked you to show his manuscript to Tom Bombadil in an effort to get the mysterious fellow to open up about his history and origin.\n8\tGoldberry has returned from her spring. During the day she can be found inside the house of Tom Bombadil, and at night she likes to walk around outside. Tom has said that you should speak with Goldberry while he looks at Bingo's manuscript.\t\n9\tTalk to Bingo outside the house of Tom Bombadil\tGoldberry may have given you the answer Bingo was seeking, and you should now return to the hobbit to see if he agrees.\n",
[4136]="700686B4\n1\tDefeat upstart fighters outside the Raven and Albatross (total: 6)\030Defeat upstart crossbowmen outside the Raven and Albatross (total: 4)\tA self-proclaimed community representative asked you to fight the brigands responsible for attacking the House of Twisted Vines in the Upper Ward. Upstart brigand fighters can be found outside the Raven and Albatross in the Upper Ward.\n2\tTalk to Dehêbix outside the House of Twisted Vines\tYou have defeated enough of the upstarts to make them think twice about disrupting the Upper Ward again. Tell Dehêbix of your success. Dehêbix can be found in the Upper Ward.\n",
[4137]="70061387\n1\tFind Clotild's house in Gamwich\tYou should find Clotild's house in Gamwich. It is located across from the Brimful Quiver Inn.\n2\tKnock on Clotild's door\tAt first glance, Clotild doesn't seem to be home. You should try knocking on her door.\n3\tWait for Clotild to answer the door\tYou should wait to see if Clotild will answer the door.\n4\tKnock on Clotild's door\tIt's possible Clotild didn't hear you knocking. You should try again.\n5\tWait for Clotild to answer the door\tYou should wait to see if Clotild will answer the door.\n6\tKnock on Clotild's door\tWell... third time's the charm?\n7\tTalk to Clotild\tSomeone is home -- most likely Clotild. You should try to talk to her through the door.\n",
[4138]="7002C362\n1\tSearch for the missing Rohirrim servant\tBrifard mentioned that the servant was gathering reeds along the shore of the Great River to the north-east. Brifard wants you to investigate the river's edge and find out what is taking the servant so long.\n2\tTalk to Brifard\tBrifard is at his camp to the north-east. Having found the remains of the servant, you should return to Brifard.\n",
[4139]="70043224\n1\tTalk to Gorhir\030Talk to Irodon\030Gather sacks of rations in the ruins of Halach (total: 6)\030Unload boats in the ruins of Halach (total: 3)\tIrodon, Gorhir, and various supplies can be found within Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. Glassiel has asked for your aid in helping the folk of Halach rebuild after the latest Haradrim assault.\n2\tTalk to Glassiel\tGlassiel can be found in the centre of the ruins of Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. You have aided in gathering and unpacking the goods of the remaining folk of Halach, and should now return to Glassiel.\n",
[4140]="70015E02\n1\tDefeat half-orcs in Târ Stazg (total: 14)\tTâr Stazg is north-east of Echad Dúnann along the mountains before the Redhorn Gate. Palanaer has asked you to journey to Târ Stazg and defeat the Half-orcs before they can reinforce Barad Morlas.\n2\tTalk to Palanaer at Echad Dúnann\tPalanaer is in Echad Dúnann south-west of Târ Stazg. You should return to Palanaer and tell him of the half-orc defeat.\n",
[4141]="700304C4\n1\tDestroy Easterling siege machines (total: 3)\tSiege machines are being built in The Woodyard, which is on the eastern side of Jóshkhin Orda. You should destroy siege-weapons of the enemy.\n2\tCompleted\tThe destruction of the Easterlings' siege-weapons will be a great boon to the defence of Floodwend, whose walls would not have withstood such an assault.\n",
[4142]="70044267\n1\tSabotage siege engines (total: 8)\tSiege equipment can be found in the northern section of Pelennor Fields. You should sabotage siege equipment.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[4143]="70043E06\n1\tGather Crawler carcasses (total: 10)\tCrawlers can be found in Osgiliath. You should collect Crawler carcasses.\n2\tBring the Crawler carcasses to Dulglok at Shrak Mauruk\tDulglok is at Shrak Mauruk. You should bring the Crawler carcasses to Dulglok.\n",
[4144]="7006C8B1\n1\tLocate the bandits hindering travellers\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg.\n2\tDefeat Khûdi bandits ([see journal]/4)\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg.\n3\tTalk to the Khûdi bandit\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits is surrendering. You should talk to him.\n4\tMeet Andur near the gate to Western Khanâg\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has agreed to meet you outside of Western Khanâg, near the southern gate.\n5\tTalk to Andur\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has agreed to meet you outside of Western Khanâg, near the southern gate. You should talk to him.\n6\tTalk to Tibira\tTibira has asked you to deal with the bandits that have placed a barricade along the road west of Western Khanâg. One of the bandits surrendered and has entered Western Khanâg, promising to do only honest work. You should return to Tibira and talk to her.\n",
[4145]="70041785\n1\tThe guards can be found in the areas surrounding the market and shipyard. You should deliver new orders to the guards.\t\n2\tTalk to Lorvegil\tLorvegil is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Lorvegil.\n",
[4146]="7006C8FD\n1\tDefeat Khûdi jackals (total: 8)\tYou should defeat jackals in Khûd Zagin in an effort to prevent further tragedies, such as the one Shalâra has suffered.\n2\tTalk to Shalâra in Western Khanâg\tYou have defeated jackals in Khûd Zagin in an effort to prevent further tragedies, such as the one Shalâra has suffered. You should return to Shalâra in Western Khanâg.\n",
[4147]="70058740\n1\tZhélruka Soldiers can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should deliver Náin the Slakeless's war orders to the Zhélruka Soldiers.\t\n",
[4148]="70025EA7\n1\tPlace the pies on the tables\tThe tables for the pies are at the Farmer's Market at Northcotton Farm. The pies are warm and smell delicious. They must be delivered to the tables at the market grounds.\n2\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the Farmer's Market on Northcotton Farm. Albin Northcotton will want to know the pies are ready for the market.\n",
[4149]="70066B21\n1\tTalk to Harthel at Melgobas\tSadrech has asked you to bring the ox parts to her husband, Harthel, in Melgobas. Melgobas can be found west of her camp.\n2\tHarthel has given you a bucket of offal to feed to the stray cats around Melgobas.\t\n3\tTalk to Harthel\tYou've fed every stray cat you could find in Melgobas. You should talk to Harthel.\n",
[4150]="700612FB\n1\tPick up the picnic basket\tThe picnic basket is beside Rosalinda North-took in Long Cleeve. Rosalinda has asked you to bring a picnic basket to her mother Meregrot.\n2\tBring the basket to Meregrot\tMeregrot is sitting by the river, south-east of Long Cleeve. Rosalinda has asked you to bring a basket of food to her mother, Meregrot.\n3\tPlace the picnic basket on the blanket\tMeregrot is sitting by the river, south-east of Long Cleeve. Meregrot North-took has asked you to place the picnic basket on the blanket beside her.\n",
[4151]="70066272\n1\tTalk to Gilanor in Ost Lontir\tGilanor can be found in Ost Lontir, to the west of Tadrent. You should deliver these supplies to him.\n",
[4152]="700085D5\n1\tUse Spirit-shrine\tThe shrine of the fell spirits is on an islet in a small pond in the southern part of Imlad Balchorth, south and a little west from Myrkworth. Gautar has asked you to go to the shrine of the fell spirits in Imlad Balchorth. The shrine can be recognized as a large iron spike, a common feature of the works of the Angmarim which might make the shrine difficult to find.\n2\tTalk to Gautar\tGautar is back at Myrkworth, north and a bit east from the shrine of Deluches. You were unable to defeat the terrible captain of the spirits, Deluches, so the fell spirits could not be banished. You should return to Gautar and report these events.\n",
[4153]="700001D6\n1\tBring relic fragments to Deluros\tThe scholar Deluros is within the library of the House of Elrond in Rivendell. Glorenglir has asked you to bring the relic fragments you recovered from the snow lurkers of the Misty Mountains to Deluros with the hope that he will recognize her readiness to advance as a scholar.\n",
[4154]="70064614\n1\tComplete any tier of delvings ([see journal]/15)\tComplete 15 delvings on any difficulty.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have completed many delvings across Middle-earth, and successfully pushed back the encroaching darkness.\n",
[4155]="70065F9F\n1\tComplete 3-person delving instances at any tier (total: 2)\030Complete 6-person delving instances at any tier (total: 2)\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have completed many difficult delvings across Middle-earth, and successfully pushed back the encroaching darkness.\n",
[4156]="70064613\n1\tComplete high tier delvings (tier 6 and higher) (total: 10)\tComplete 10 high tier delvings across Middle-earth (tier 6 and higher).\n2\tCompleted\tYou have completed many difficult delvings across Middle-earth, and successfully pushed back the encroaching darkness.\n",
[4157]="70064EF2\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Delvings barter currency allowance.\n",
[4158]="70062CD7\n1\tSearch for the missing arrow\tDelyth Saethur has asked you to recover her missing arrow. The arrow went missing in Clegur.\n2\tFollow the tracks\tWhile searching for Delyth Saethur's missing arrow, you have come across large, reptilian footprints. You should follow the footprints and confront the creature who stole the arrow.\n3\tBring the arrow to Delyth\tYou should bring the arrow to Delyth Saethur. Delyth is in Clegur.\n4\tRinse off the arrow\tYou managed to recover Delyth's arrow, but it's a bit worse for the wear. She has asked you to rinse it off in the nearby river. The river is located next to Clegur.\n5\tBring the cleansed arrow to Delyth\tYou should bring the cleansed arrow to Delyth. Delyth is in Clegur.\n",
[4159]="70067C44\n1\tReturn the meat and shells to Keteph\030Collect crab shells ([see journal]/8)\030Collect delectable crab meat ([see journal]/8)\tKeteph requested you return to the shore to collect more ingredients. His feast was successful, and his culinary skills are in high demand! The people require a new recipe to sate their hunger, and the key ingredient is crab. Head to the shores south and west of Jax Phanâl, collect delectable crab meat crab shells and return them to him.\n",
[4160]="70037C15\n1\tCollect crates of Kingstead crops (total: 8)\tCrates of Kingstead crops can be found along the road to Middlemead in eastern Kingstead. You have discovered a crate of crops that has survived the Uruk onslaught. You should recover as many as you can to aid the forces at Entwade.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have recovered many crates of Kingstead crops and should now prepare to return them to Entwade.\n",
})
